Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:48.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}对  我会想明天要到谁家过夜{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I think about whose apartment we'll sleep at tomorrow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}下星期六要到哪里吃晚餐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and where we'll have dinner next Saturday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我不会去想我们孩子的名字{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I do not think about our children's names!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你知道我们孩子的名字{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know what our children's names will be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.17,0:14:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哈哈  不知{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ha, ha, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.79,0:15:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  我看过一本书  里面有个女孩叫艾蜜莉{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}No, I mean, you know. I read a book, and there was a girl named Emily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我觉得那会是个好名字{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And I thought that might be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.64,0:15:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哪本书{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What was the book?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}《儿童命名宝典》{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}The Big Book of Children's Names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  罗斯{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay. Ross, Ross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}听我说{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们的关系非常棒  对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What we have is amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}但我不要别人帮我决定人生{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But I do not want everything decided for me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.57,0:15:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我一直都过着那样的生活{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I spent my whole life like that.{\r}
