Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  谢谢{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, fine! Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.58,0:15:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我还没有说完  我不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}We're not done! I didn't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}跟你在一起的男人 一直在计划他跟你的未来{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You're with a guy who won't stop planning his future with you.{\r}
