Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:45.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}如果那吓坏了你  你必须接受{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}If that scares you, tough! You'll have to deal with that.{\r}
