Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是我们第一次那么说  对{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}That's the first time we've said that!  Yes.{\r}
