Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:28.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}《去他的鬼人生 你不会相信人生就是这么惨》{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}"It's a Sucky Life, And Just When You Think It Can't Suck Anymore, It Does!"{\r}
