Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}哇  看看我挖的这个大洞  柏特{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow. Look at this nice deep hole I dug. Hey, Bert...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.61,0:21:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这个洞很漂亮吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...isn't this a nice hole here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好的  恩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, ahem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.70,0:21:47.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}小班  这时厄尼把柏特埋在沙里  然后找不到他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ben, this is the part where Ernie buries Bert in the sand and can't find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.79,0:21:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我用快转看过录影带  后来他又找到他{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Now, I've looked ahead on the tape, and he does find him again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}在那之前  发生了一些不好的事{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But before that happens, there's some rough going for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.88,0:21:59.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想我们应该可以应付{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}But I think we can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.21,0:22:05.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}还有字母歌  我们知道结局一定会很快乐{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}And there's just the alphabet, but we know that ends well, so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}来吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:08.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}柏特  柏特{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Bert? Bert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}柏特{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Bert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.52,0:22:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我朋友柏特怎么了  刚刚他还在这里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}What happened to my friend Bert? He was here just a moment ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.31,0:22:16.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不  我的老朋友柏特不见了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Oh, no! My old friend Bert is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.61,0:22:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我很高兴你在这里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Mm. I'm so glad you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.74,0:22:22.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（再见，宝贝）{\r}
